<title>GERMANY: Dresdner says plans strong growth in Asia.</title>
<headline>Dresdner says plans strong growth in Asia.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dresdner Bank group intends to strengthen its Asian business significantly in coming years and may boost its earnings from the region to 20 percent of its overall income in the medium term, a top official said.</p>
</text>
